x)=1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-65231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "789647efc47e67cffb1b5477a7d074db79cdbe37071cba63283bf1370f324314"} {"question" "q-65231" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-65231" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2{sin}^{2}⁡x"] ["math" "1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x"] ["math" "1+{sin}^{2}⁡x"] ["math" "1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x"] ["math" "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-65231" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-119863" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\frac{1-{cos}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x{sin}^{2}⁡x}=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-119863" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we rewrite the numerator using $1-{cos}^{2}⁡x={sin}^{2}⁡x:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1-{cos}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x{sin}^{2}⁡x}=\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x{sin}^{2}⁡x}\n$$\n\nNext, we simplify as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x{sin}^{2}⁡x} & =\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot {sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡x}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{1-{cos}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x{sin}^{2}⁡x}=\\operatorname{sec}⁡x.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-119863" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "789647efc47e67cffb1b5477a7d074db79cdbe37071cba63283bf1370f324314"} {"question" "q-119863" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-119863" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x"] ["math" "1-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sec}⁡x"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+1"] ["math" "{sec}^{2}⁡x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-119863" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sec}⁡x"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-119867" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Simplify $\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-119867" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we rewrite the numerator of the first term using $1-{sin}^{2}⁡x={cos}^{2}⁡x.$\n\n$$\n\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x=\\frac{1-{sin}^{2}⁡x}{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\n$$\n\nNext, we factor the numerator of the first term as a difference of squares, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1-{sin}^{2}⁡x}{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x & =\\frac{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}{\\cancel{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{1}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972325/state.json" "file_sha256" "0d6010443fab46eee3cb4ab3cf76eab2466efba1a76cea7725235c40135f67f5"} {"question" "q-119867" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :q